                                <p><p>Haye sakina..(2)<br />
rona bhi hai baba pe aansu bhi chupane hai..(2)<br />
zindaa&#39;n mein sakina ko..(2)<br />
ye ghum bhi uthane hai<br />
rona bhi hai baba pe aansu bhi chupane hai..(2)</p>

<p>1. Shabbir ke baccho&#39;n mein, ek aisi yateema hai<br />
